{"schema":"forgedock.run-event/v1","eventId":"467930c6-1e82-498f-b43d-d7228b249ce7","runId":"19e8cece-ac5f-4cf1-b102-0ee9587d0a71","repository":"RapierCraftStudios/forgedock-pi","sequence":19,"previousEventHash":"sha256:4f1be480ac779ab91da7f63cf542b85c28e24477781082794178d4b578849ceb","type":"effect.recorded","actor":{"kind":"extension","sessionId":"01a0433e-d47e-700c-afe0-69d5a3e92889","leaseEpoch":1},"occurredAt":"2026-08-27T12:47:58.423Z","idempotencyKey":"effect:github-label:RapierCraftStudios/forgedock-pi:196:eccaf2d7-5dd7-4590-8e0b-30b120a4dfc4","payload":{"effectType":"github-label","effectId":"github-label:RapierCraftStudios/forgedock-pi:196:eccaf2d7-5dd7-4590-8e0b-30b120a4dfc4","digest":"sha256:2e8055cfcb5a479f60d02b5ce0337397812063bfb3d03245071d9a4f0ecf0606"}}
{"schema":"forgedock.run-event/v1","eventId":"1105b84f-63ae-47e9-99c5-05b39700a495","runId":"19e8cece-ac5f-4cf1-b102-0ee9587d0a71","repository":"RapierCraftStudios/forgedock-pi","sequence":20,"previousEventHash":"sha256:8a4c2d427029de4baa6ecf892f0ae4551a81bcdc346135965df74fe941a96113","type":"phase.completed","actor":{"kind":"extension","sessionId":"01a0433e-d47e-700c-afe0-69d5a3e92889","leaseEpoch":1},"occurredAt":"2026-08-27T12:48:33.401Z","idempotencyKey":"phase:plan:1:complete","payload":{"phase":"plan","attempt":1,"evidence":[],"report":"<!-- FORGE:CONTRACT -->\n## Builder Contract\n\n### Objective\n\nPin the existing fail-closed behavior for pnpm `--filter-prod` with focused regression coverage, without changing production parsing or broadening verification policy.\n\n### Allowed Paths\n\n- `test/adapters/verification-preflight.test.ts`\n\n### Forbidden Changes\n\n- No changes to production adapter behavior.\n- No policy, schema, workflow, GitHub, branch, or authority changes.\n- No new dependencies or verification commands.\n\n### Invariants\n\n- Package-manager options in tracked verification commands remain unsupported and fail closed.\n- The test reaches package-manager parsing rather than failing only because pnpm is unavailable.\n- Existing npm selector and script validation behavior remains unchanged.\n\n### Deliverables\n\n- A fixture-local executable named `pnpm`.\n- A regression argv case for `pnpm --filter-prod web test`.\n- Passing required `check` verification.\n- Fresh correctness and security review on the committed head.\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] `AC-1`: Validate the reported bypass against frozen staging.\n- [ ] `AC-2`: Add focused regression coverage for pnpm `--filter-prod`.\n- [ ] `AC-3`: Pass required local `check` verification.\n- [ ] `AC-4`: Complete fresh correctness and security review.\n\n<!-- FORGE:CONTEXT -->\n## Implementation Context\n\n### History\n\nThe issue derives from PR `#192`, while frozen `staging` already uses generic option rejection instead of the selector list described in the original finding.\n\n### Callers And Data Flow\n\n`preflightRequiredVerificationCommands` resolves the command directory, validates executable availability, then calls `packageScriptName`. The regression fixture must therefore make `pnpm` executable before asserting that command-position `--filter-prod` is rejected.\n\n### CI Surface\n\nThe repository requires the named `check` command, which runs TypeScript type checking and the complete Node test suite.\n\n### Prior Findings\n\nThe source finding identified a production-safety risk where preflight and execution could disagree about workspace selection. Current generic rejection closes that route; exact test coverage prevents regression.\n\n### Hazards\n\n- A test without a fixture pnpm executable could pass for the wrong reason.\n- Altering production parsing would be unnecessary and could widen scope.\n\n<!-- FORGE:CONTEXT:COMPLETE -->\n\n<!-- FORGE:ARCHITECT -->\n## Implementation Plan\n\n1. Extend the test fixture to create an executable `pnpm` shim alongside `npm`.\n2. Add `['pnpm', '--filter-prod', 'web', 'test']` to malformed root metadata selector cases.\n3. Run the bound `check` verification command.\n4. Commit the focused test change, prepare the PR, and run the required fresh reviewer panel.\n\n<!-- FORGE:ARCHITECT:COMPLETE -->","outputArtifactHash":"sha256:plan-196-pnpm-filter-prod-test"}}
